OL,3,GNEWSARoyal Marines and soldiers settle
OL,4,AMoD asbestos claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe MoD, which did not accept
OL,7,Fliability, said action had been taken
OL,8,Fto "prevent similar issues arising in
OL,9,Fthe future" and further use of the
OL,10,Fnon-MOD training site had been
OL,11,Fprohibited.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
